        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kurt Fuller, Steve Franks, Carrie Quinn Dolin, Laura Bush, Karl Rove\n- Places: Stockton, California\n- Organizations: Lincoln High School, University of California, Berkeley, USA Network, ION Television\n- Products: Psych, That's My Bush!\n- Topics: Education, Television casting\n\nFacts:\n- Kurt Fuller graduated from Lincoln High School in Stockton, California, in 1971.\n- Kurt Fuller graduated from the University of California, Berkeley, in 1976.\n- Psych is an American detective comedy-drama television series created by Steve Franks.\n- Psych was broadcast on USA Network and later had syndicated reruns on ION Television.\n- In That's My Bush!, Carrie Quinn Dolin played Laura Bush.\n- In That's My Bush!, Kurt Fuller played Karl Rove.",
